## Original Content
Власти Анапы запросили спецвертолёт для борьбы с природным пожаром на территории заповедника "Утриш", начавшегося после падения беспилотника, сообщила глава города-курорта Светлана Маслова."В заповеднике "Утриш" тушат пожар.

## Summary
A natural wildfire spanning 3.5 hectares broke out in the Utrish nature reserve near Anapa after a drone crashed in the area. The city authorities have requested a special firefighting helicopter to help extinguish the blaze.

## Key Points
- A natural fire covering 3.5 hectares is burning in the Utrish nature reserve near Anapa
- The fire was caused by the crash of an unmanned aerial vehicle (drone)
- Anapa authorities requested a special helicopter to assist with firefighting efforts
- City head Svetlana Maslova confirmed that firefighters are actively working to extinguish the blaze


